**Motion sensor in the room:** When a selected sensor detects motion, Memolumen applies its "Motion" rules (turn on at night, duration, turn off during the day without motion) – even without the tablet camera. Clear the field to unpair.

**Doorbell:** When the doorbell rings, the frame shows the live image of the selected camera – even at night or in away mode. It can be triggered by entities (e.g. a doorbell input) and/or a webhook called e.g. by a Shelly. Memolumen needs the Home Assistant address and a long-lived access token under "Home Assistant → Connection to Home Assistant".

Current webhook address: {webhook_url}
